      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-biotic-lash",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You extend a whip-like biotic tendril that snares an enemy and violently yanks them toward you, dealing damage on impact.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>30 feet</strong>. The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-biotic-lash] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is pulled up to <strong>30 feet</strong> toward you and takes @Damage[(2*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage. If pulled adjacent to you, it is Off-Guard until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[(4*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage and the target is also <strong>Grabbed</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
